% CHALLENGES
\sectiontitle{Challenges/Roadblocks (7 pts)}

\vspace{0.02cm}
\vspace{0.15cm}

\answerboxauto{\textbf{1. 3D Mouse Tile Mapping:} Converting 2D screen mouse clicks onto an angled 3D plane was initially inaccurate. \textit{Solution:} Implemented mathematical ray-plane intersection at $Y=0$ using Raylib's \texttt{GetMouseRay}, resolving exact board tile coordinates from camera hit points.\\[3pt]
\textbf{2. C-to-C++ Linker Interfacing:} Linking C source files containing dynamic allocations to C++ graphical code caused linkage and casting errors. \textit{Solution:} Encapsulated C header declarations using \texttt{extern "C"} in \texttt{dsa.h} and standardized common data structures.\\[3pt]
\textbf{3. Search Depth and Branching Latency:} Deeper minimax recursion slowed real-time response. \textit{Solution:} Implemented MVV-LVA move sorting prior to alpha-beta pruning, ensuring early branch cutoffs and responsive play.}

